## Summary

Fixes iOS/Clang build failures introduced by the Wave 2 D12 O-badge About modal feature. Three hard errors in `AboutModal.h` (overloaded-virtual conflict, const mutation, invalid hex escape) cascaded into spurious `XOceanusEditor` Component-inheritance failures across the entire file. Merge conflicts with `origin/main` (Wave 2 landing) have also been resolved.

## Engines Affected

none

## Testing Performed

- [ ] `cmake --build build` passes with no errors
- [ ] `auval -v aumu Xolk XoOx` passes (required if audio code was touched)
- [ ] Preset smoke test — affected engine presets load and produce sound
- [ ] No regressions in coupling routes involving affected engines

## Checklist

- [ ] No dead parameters introduced (D004 — every declared param affects audio output)
- [ ] No memory allocations on the audio thread
- [ ] No blocking I/O on the audio thread
- [ ] Parameter IDs are unchanged (frozen after first release)
- [ ] If a new engine was added: CLAUDE.md checklist completed (4 sections updated)
- [ ] If presets were added/changed: `.xometa` format correct, 6D DNA filled, macros produce audible change
- [ ] If coupling was touched: routes don't propagate back to MIDI layer (B016)

## Notes for Reviewer

**`AboutModal.h`** — three fixes:

1. **`-Woverloaded-virtual` (treated as error on iOS/Clang):** `AboutModal` was multiply-inheriting `juce::Component` + `juce::KeyListener`, whose `keyPressed` overloads conflict. Removed `KeyListener` base; switched to `Component::keyPressed(const juce::KeyPress&)`. Added `setWantsKeyboardFocus(true)` + `grabKeyboardFocus()` in `openTab()` so Escape still routes correctly.

2. **`const` mutation:** `const auto cardR = getCardBounds()` immediately called `cardR.removeFromTop()` (non-const). Removed `const`.

3. **Invalid hex escape:** `"\xe2\x88\xbc"` (UTF-8 tilde) rejected by iOS/Clang as an out-of-range hex escape in a narrow string literal. Replaced with `"~"`.

**`XOceanusEditor.h`** — two additions + one fix:

- Ported the D12 O-badge + About modal wiring from the `wave2` branch (`#include "AboutModal.h"`, `initOceanView` setup, `resized()` bounds, member variables).
- `juce::TooltipWindow tooltipWindow{this, 400}` → `tooltipWindow(this, 400)` — brace-init causes constructor resolution ambiguity under iOS/Clang.

**Merge conflict resolution** — conflicts introduced when `origin/main` landed the full Wave 2 changeset:

- `AboutModal.h`: 7 conflict hunks resolved, all keeping the iOS build fixes over the pre-fix originals. End-of-file artifact (`___BEGIN___COMMAND_DONE_MARKER___0`) removed.
- `XOceanusEditor.h`: conflict in `onClick` lambda comment resolved (kept the `TODO D12: long-press → Lore tab` note from main); duplicate `obadge_.setBounds` / `aboutModal_.setBounds` block removed from `resized()` (both sides independently added identical code during the merge).

